{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/24608-ctd-question-can-a-childling-take-title","id":24608,"title":"CTD Question: Can a Childling take Title?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-06T13:39:05-08:00","id":24608,"title":"CTD Question: Can a Childling take Title?","content":"One of the things that is omnipresent in CTD is very young protaganists... something I was wondering, is it a good idea , nevertheless to limit Title to those at least 13 years old, in the Enchanted book in the section on Kithain life cycle it sounds like thats when those with noble aspirations begin training.<br /> <br /> just a thought.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-06T14:29:05-08:00","id":24649,"title":"","content":"I actually don't pay much attention to the Kithain life cycle as presented in the Enchanted book when I run games. It gets contradicted by almost all the published NPCs. I'll draw from it if it adds to a game. If it doesn't, I ignore it.<br /> <br /> I don't have a problem with young characters having title. It seems very in theme for Changeling: The Dreaming to me for someone in their mortal life to be too young to be given responsibilities, but in reality they have more responsibilities than the mortals around them will every know. Also the imagery of an old soul in a very young body is very fitting for Dreaming.<br /> <br /> And besides, my all time favorite fairy ruler is Princess Ozma - a fourteen year old girl who rules over the entirety of Oz. Baum's Oz books were definitely some of the inspiration for Changeling.<br /> <br /> So yeah, I wouldn't lay down a blanket rule like that in any game I run. That being said, I would look at the character the player wants to play and see if it adds anything to the character or the game and fits in with story being told.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}